+> STOP. Captain's notes: non-binding. Captain writes, Captain trims. Anyone else: close this file now.
+
+# Captain Notes
+
+Binding behaviour lives in `.feature` specs and referenced `assets/**`. History lives in git. These notes carry only what the next cycle needs.
+
+## Current Voyage
+
+Build a TodoMVC app: vanilla JavaScript, localStorage persistence, full routing. Assets: `assets/app-spec.md` (product spec), `assets/app-template.index.html` (base markup). Dependencies already declared in `RIGGING.md`: `@cucumber/cucumber`, `happy-dom`, `todomvc-app-css`, `todomvc-common`, `c8`. The `todomvc-app-css` and `todomvc-common` packages must be installed before implementation begins; verify they resolve from `node_modules/` before dispatching Crew.
+
+## Watchbill
+
+Three watches ordered for inner-loop economy: core behaviour first, then persistence, then routing. Each watch's targets are the scenarios that must go green before the next watch starts.
+
+## Next Step
+
+Dispatch QM with the watchbill. QM writes verification support and step definitions, then dispatches Crew per failing target.
