+Feature: TodoMVC core functionality
+  As a user managing tasks
+  I want a reliable todo application
+  So that I can track, complete, and organise my work
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded in the browser
+
+  # --- Empty state ---
+
+  Scenario: No todos hides main and footer
+    Given the todo list is empty
+    Then the main section is hidden
+    And the footer is hidden
+
+  # --- Creating todos ---
+
+  Scenario: Creating a new todo
+    Given the todo list is empty
+    When the user types "Buy milk" in the new-todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list contains 1 item
+    And the new-todo input is empty
+    And the todo at index 0 has title "Buy milk" and is not completed
+
+  Scenario: Empty input does not create a todo
+    Given the todo list is empty
+    When the user types "" in the new-todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list is empty
+
+  Scenario: Whitespace-only input does not create a todo
+    Given the todo list is empty
+    When the user types "   " in the new-todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list is empty
+
+  Scenario: Input is trimmed before creating a todo
+    Given the todo list is empty
+    When the user types "  Buy milk  " in the new-todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo at index 0 has title "Buy milk" and is not completed
+
+  # --- Completing todos ---
+
+  Scenario: Toggle a single todo to completed
+    Given a todo "Buy milk" exists
+    When the user toggles the checkbox for todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is completed
+    And the item count shows "0 items left"
+
+  Scenario: Uncomplete a todo
+    Given a completed todo "Buy milk" exists
+    When the user toggles the checkbox for todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is not completed
+    And the item count shows "1 item left"
+
+  # --- Mark all as complete ---
+
+  Scenario: Toggle all marks every todo complete
+    Given these todos exist:
+      | title         | completed |
+      | Buy milk      | false     |
+      | Walk the dog  | false     |
+    When the user toggles the toggle-all checkbox on
+    Then all todos are completed
+    And the item count shows "0 items left"
+
+  Scenario: Toggle all reflects individual completion
+    Given these todos exist:
+      | title         | completed |
+      | Buy milk      | true      |
+      | Walk the dog  | false     |
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is unchecked
+
+  Scenario: Toggle all becomes checked when all individual todos are completed
+    Given these todos exist:
+      | title         | completed |
+      | Buy milk      | false     |
+      | Walk the dog  | false     |
+    When the user toggles the checkbox for todo "Buy milk"
+    When the user toggles the checkbox for todo "Walk the dog"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+
+  # --- Editing todos ---
+
+  Scenario: Double-click activates editing mode
+    Given a todo "Buy milk" exists
+    When the user double-clicks the label for todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is in editing mode
+
+  Scenario: Edit saves on Enter
+    Given a todo "Buy milk" exists
+    When the user double-clicks the label for todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user clears the edit input and types "Buy eggs" and presses Enter
+    Then the todo at index 0 has title "Buy eggs" and is not completed
+    And the todo "Buy eggs" is not in editing mode
+
+  Scenario: Edit saves on blur
+    Given a todo "Buy milk" exists
+    When the user double-clicks the label for todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user clears the edit input and types "Buy eggs" and triggers blur
+    Then the todo at index 0 has title "Buy eggs" and is not completed
+
+  Scenario: Empty edit destroys the todo
+    Given a todo "Buy milk" exists
+    When the user double-clicks the label for todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user clears the edit input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list is empty
+
+  Scenario: Edit cancels on Escape
+    Given a todo "Buy milk" exists
+    When the user double-clicks the label for todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user clears the edit input and types "Buy eggs" and presses Escape
+    Then the todo at index 0 has title "Buy milk" and is not completed
+
+  # --- Deleting todos ---
+
+  Scenario: Delete a todo
+    Given a todo "Buy milk" exists
+    When the user clicks the destroy button for todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo list is empty
+
+  # --- Counter ---
+
+  Scenario: Counter shows correct count
+    Given these todos exist:
+      | title         | completed |
+      | Buy milk      | false     |
+      | Walk the dog  | true      |
+    Then the item count shows "1 item left"
+
+  Scenario: Counter is pluralised correctly
+    Given a todo "Buy milk" exists
+    Then the item count shows "1 item left"
+    When the user types "Walk the dog" in the new-todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the item count shows "2 items left"
+
+  # --- Clear completed ---
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed removes completed todos
+    Given these todos exist:
+      | title         | completed |
+      | Buy milk      | false     |
+      | Walk the dog  | true      |
+    When the user clicks the Clear completed button
+    Then the todo list contains 1 item
+    And the todo at index 0 has title "Buy milk" and is not completed
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed is hidden when no completed todos exist
+    Given a todo "Buy milk" exists
+    Then the Clear completed button is hidden
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed is shown when completed todos exist
+    Given a completed todo "Buy milk" exists
+    Then the Clear completed button is visible
+
+  # --- Persistence ---
+
+  Scenario: Todos persist across page reload
+    Given a todo "Buy milk" exists
+    When the page is reloaded
+    Then the todo list contains 1 item
+    And the todo at index 0 has title "Buy milk" and is not completed
+
+  Scenario: Completed state persists across page reload
+    Given a completed todo "Buy milk" exists
+    When the page is reloaded
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is completed
+
+  # --- Routing ---
+
+  Scenario: All route shows all todos
+    Given these todos exist:
+      | title         | completed |
+      | Buy milk      | false     |
+      | Walk the dog  | true      |
+    When the user navigates to the "All" filter
+    Then the visible todo list contains 2 items
+
+  Scenario: Active route shows only incomplete todos
+    Given these todos exist:
+      | title         | completed |
+      | Buy milk      | false     |
+      | Walk the dog  | true      |
+    When the user navigates to the "Active" filter
+    Then the visible todo list contains 1 item
+    And the visible todo at index 0 has title "Buy milk"
+
+  Scenario: Completed route shows only completed todos
+    Given these todos exist:
+      | title         | completed |
+      | Buy milk      | false     |
+      | Walk the dog  | true      |
+    When the user navigates to the "Completed" filter
+    Then the visible todo list contains 1 item
+    And the visible todo at index 0 has title "Walk the dog"
+
+  Scenario: Active filter is persisted on reload
+    Given a completed todo "Buy milk" exists
+    When the user navigates to the "Active" filter
+    And the page is reloaded
+    Then the "Active" filter is selected
+
+  Scenario: Completed todo disappears from list when completed while on Active filter
+    Given these todos exist:
+      | title         | completed |
+      | Buy milk      | false     |
+      | Walk the dog  | false     |
+    When the user navigates to the "Active" filter
+    And the user toggles the checkbox for todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the visible todo list contains 1 item
